              <h3><a name="p-12113964-update-july-14-2025-1" class="anchor" href="#p-12113964-update-july-14-2025-1"></a>[Update] July 14, 2025</h3>
<aside class="quote quote-modified" data-post="144" data-topic="3532432">
  <div class="title">
    <div class="quote-controls"></div>
    <img alt="" width="24" height="24" src="https://doy2mn9upadnk.cloudfront.net/user_avatar/devforum.roblox.com/phri/60/7853355_2.png" class="avatar">
    <a href="https://devforum.roblox.com/t/longer-video-uploads-more-video-uploads/3532432/144">Longer video uploads, more video uploads!</a> <a class="badge-category__wrapper " href="/c/updates/announcements/36"><span data-category-id="36" style="--category-badge-color: #E2231A; --category-badge-text-color: #FFFFFF; --parent-category-badge-color: #E2231A;" data-parent-category-id="45" data-drop-close="true" class="badge-category --has-parent" title="Official announcements about Roblox products and features"><span class="badge-category__name">Announcements</span></span></a>
  </div>
  <blockquote>
    Hi all - exciting news to share! <img width="20" height="20" src="https://doy2mn9upadnk.cloudfront.net/images/emoji/twitter/drum.png?v=14" title="drum" alt="drum" class="emoji"> 
As of this week, EVEN LONGER VIDEO UPLOADS, EVEN MORE VIDEO UPLOADS: 

Quintupled the maximum video upload duration to 5 minutes
Trigintupled the monthly video upload quota to a daily quota of 10 uploads/day

<a href="https://devforum.roblox.com/t/longer-video-uploads-more-video-uploads/3532432#p-12113964-plans-for-the-future-4">Our plans for the future</a> are underway to bring you even more video-y goodness. Thanks all for your continued feedback. <img width="20" height="20" src="https://doy2mn9upadnk.cloudfront.net/images/emoji/twitter/pray.png?v=14" title="pray" alt="pray" class="emoji"> 
 <a class="lightbox" href="//devforum-uploads.s3.dualstack.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/uploads/original/5X/e/e/1/1/ee1137cf2189e3cfc5193d215c408d1f0bb4ae5a.jpeg" data-download-href="/uploads/short-url/xY2wHdh0PoBfbur6qRcxni7AtaG.jpeg?dl=1" title="image" rel="noopener nofollow ugc">[image]</a>
  </blockquote>
</aside>

<hr>
<p>Howdy folks! <img src="https://doy2mn9upadnk.cloudfront.net/images/emoji/twitter/waving_hand.png?v=14" title=":waving_hand:" class="emoji" alt=":waving_hand:" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20"></p>
<h3><a name="p-12113964-got-a-sweet-but-definitely-not-short-announcement-2" class="anchor" href="#p-12113964-got-a-sweet-but-definitely-not-short-announcement-2"></a>Got a sweet, but definitely not short, announcement…</h3>
<p>We’ve heard your feedback regarding <a href="https://devforum.roblox.com/t/video-uploads-beta-add-short-form-video-to-your-experience/2630621/">Video Uploads [Beta]</a>, and are excited to announce two adjustments:</p>
<ul>
<li>We have doubled the maximum video upload duration to <strong>60 seconds</strong>.</li>
<li>We have tripled the monthly video upload quota to <strong>10 uploads</strong>.</li>
</ul>
<h3><a name="p-12113964-h-635x300uploadquso7glc65ianmo4umoym4voz7ypng-3" class="anchor" href="#p-12113964-h-635x300uploadquso7glc65ianmo4umoym4voz7ypng-3"></a><div class="lightbox-wrapper"><a class="lightbox" href="//devforum-uploads.s3.dualstack.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/uploads/original/5X/b/9/b/6/b9b640e4faa136cd3880a26e182d16bdb41ad65a.png" data-download-href="/uploads/short-url/quSO7gLC65IANMO4umOyM4vOz7Y.png?dl=1" title="" rel="noopener nofollow ugc"><img src="//devforum-uploads.s3.dualstack.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/uploads/optimized/5X/b/9/b/6/b9b640e4faa136cd3880a26e182d16bdb41ad65a_2_635x300.png" alt="" data-base62-sha1="quSO7gLC65IANMO4umOyM4vOz7Y" width="635" height="300" role="presentation" srcset="//devforum-uploads.s3.dualstack.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/uploads/optimized/5X/b/9/b/6/b9b640e4faa136cd3880a26e182d16bdb41ad65a_2_635x300.png, //devforum-uploads.s3.dualstack.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/uploads/optimized/5X/b/9/b/6/b9b640e4faa136cd3880a26e182d16bdb41ad65a_2_952x450.png 1.5x, //devforum-uploads.s3.dualstack.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/uploads/optimized/5X/b/9/b/6/b9b640e4faa136cd3880a26e182d16bdb41ad65a_2_1270x600.png 2x" data-dominant-color="636363"><div class="meta"><svg class="fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#far-image"></use></svg><span class="filename"></span><span class="informations">1600×755 238 KB</span><svg class="fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#discourse-expand"></use></svg></div></a></div></h3>
<h3><a name="p-12113964-plans-for-the-future-4" class="anchor" href="#p-12113964-plans-for-the-future-4"></a>Plans for the future…</h3>
<ol>
<li>Video upload support for remaining Roblox-supported languages (in case you missed it, <a href="https://devforum.roblox.com/t/video-uploads-now-available-in-five-more-languages/3386047">video uploads are now available in five more languages!</a>)</li>
<li>Adjustments to the video upload fee, monthly quota, and max duration</li>
<li>Video uploads <a href="https://devforum.roblox.com/t/video-uploads-beta-add-short-form-video-to-your-experience/2630621">exit Studio beta</a></li>
</ol>
<p><em><img src="https://doy2mn9upadnk.cloudfront.net/images/emoji/twitter/books.png?v=14" title=":books:" class="emoji" alt=":books:" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20"> For more information on how to upload + use videos, <a href="https://create.roblox.com/docs/ui/video-frames">we have this helpful documentation</a> at your disposal.</em></p>
<p>We look forward to seeing how you put this to creative use!<br>
- Roblox Video Team</p>
